# Simulation run artifacts. The harness writes its JSON report to sim-out/ (the
# container bind-mount target) and run.sh copies it to the repo root for
# convenience. Both are per-run output, regenerated by ./sim/run.sh, and the
# root copy would otherwise sit untracked-but-unignored next to sim/ — inviting
# a `git add -A` to sweep a 70KB machine-specific report into history.
sim-out/
sim-report.json
